WEBVTT

01:41.990 --> 01:49.020
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.690 --> 01:51.830
[Episode 7]

01:55.560 --> 01:56.420
Tang Tingting!

01:58.310 --> 01:59.120
Lin Zhixia?

02:00.000 --> 02:00.800
What's wrong?

02:01.680 --> 02:03.140
I want to apologize to you.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.280
For what?

02:07.350 --> 02:08.280
We lost

02:08.680 --> 02:11.000
the math contest, because of my arrogance

02:11.000 --> 02:12.400
and mistaken decisions—

02:12.400 --> 02:13.730
I'm so sorry about that.

02:14.280 --> 02:15.750
It's all in the past.

02:16.190 --> 02:16.840
No.

02:17.360 --> 02:19.560
If you hadn't participated
in this contest,

02:19.560 --> 02:20.910
I probably would have failed already

02:20.910 --> 02:22.170
when forming the team.

02:22.590 --> 02:25.050
Then, we made a plan
for intensive training.

02:25.710 --> 02:27.150
But at the last moment,

02:28.030 --> 02:29.960
I ignored my teammates' opinions.

02:30.560 --> 02:32.870
I think my distrust at the time

02:33.120 --> 02:34.360
must have hurt you.

02:37.360 --> 02:39.190
Let me tell you something funny.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.120
What is it?

02:42.680 --> 02:43.750
An underachiever who

02:43.750 --> 02:45.430
got into the experimental class by luck

02:45.430 --> 02:47.470
signed up for the provincial math contest

02:47.470 --> 02:49.270
and aimed for the championship.

02:49.560 --> 02:50.620
During the finals,

02:50.910 --> 02:53.030
she blamed herself for getting
a mandatory question wrong

02:53.030 --> 02:54.360
and almost broke down.

02:55.030 --> 02:56.030
After pulling herself together,

02:56.030 --> 02:58.590
she decided to turn the tide
with a decision

02:58.750 --> 03:00.080
and secure the championship.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.120
After the contest,

03:01.120 --> 03:03.120
she was full of remorse

03:03.120 --> 03:04.710
for only winning runner-up.

03:04.710 --> 03:06.360
With her mother's encouragement
and comfort,

03:06.360 --> 03:07.890
she finally found herself.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.430
She finally remembered—

03:09.430 --> 03:11.690
she was just an underachiever after all.

03:13.710 --> 03:15.960
Lin Zhixia, if it weren't for you,

03:15.960 --> 03:18.760
I wouldn't have
so many inspiring stories to tell.

03:23.030 --> 03:24.150
I just don't know

03:24.150 --> 03:26.210
the next time there's a contest like this,

03:26.210 --> 03:27.740
will Lin Zhixia think of me?

03:28.560 --> 03:29.160
Of course!

03:32.870 --> 03:33.470
Next time,

03:34.240 --> 03:35.370
the time after next,

03:35.430 --> 03:36.150
and the time after that,

03:36.150 --> 03:37.280
we will always be teammates.

03:37.280 --> 03:37.870
Okay!

03:41.560 --> 03:42.090
Let's go.

03:47.370 --> 03:48.230
Listen to this.

03:48.860 --> 03:50.920
My idol's new song.
It's really good.

03:59.180 --> 04:00.740
This medal is really nice.

04:01.020 --> 04:02.350
Look at that engraving.

04:08.500 --> 04:08.930
Tang!

04:15.500 --> 04:16.860
You've been wearing that medal for days.

04:16.860 --> 04:18.660
Aren't you afraid of getting a heat rash?

04:18.660 --> 04:19.930
This heavy medal

04:19.930 --> 04:21.730
is about to bend your small body.

04:21.769 --> 04:27.410
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

04:24.630 --> 04:25.920
Achievements

04:26.450 --> 04:28.250
are always heavy.

04:28.620 --> 04:30.880
I'd rather my body be bent a little lower.

04:31.620 --> 04:34.980
The ripe ear of wheat hangs low.

04:44.330 --> 04:45.390
Still annoyed?

04:47.750 --> 04:48.600
It doesn't matter.

04:48.600 --> 04:50.040
There will be a next time.

04:51.159 --> 04:52.420
You don't understand.

04:52.510 --> 04:54.310
It's really very hard this time.

04:57.300 --> 04:58.830
What are you talking about?

05:01.770 --> 05:03.300
What are you talking about?

05:03.720 --> 05:05.560
Aren't we talking about the contest?

05:05.560 --> 05:06.240
I'm talking about

05:06.240 --> 05:08.240
Han Geng's first concert here.

05:10.600 --> 05:11.720
All that talk—

05:12.010 --> 05:13.160
what you were calling hard was...

05:13.160 --> 05:14.420
It's hard to buy the tickets.

05:14.420 --> 05:15.560
I've prepared the money,

05:15.560 --> 05:16.830
but I can't get a ticket.

05:16.830 --> 05:19.290
My last resort would be going to queue
at 3 AM.

05:19.830 --> 05:22.240
Tang Tingting. Tang Tingting.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.870
You can't just be obsessed...

05:25.000 --> 05:26.600
with chasing celebrities.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.000
Can't you be more like me?

05:28.240 --> 05:29.800
I only care about studying.

05:31.800 --> 05:33.830
Duan Qiyan, let me give you some advice.

05:33.830 --> 05:34.630
Go ahead.

05:34.920 --> 05:37.360
Eighty years from now,
write on your epitaph,

05:37.360 --> 05:38.890
"In the 10th-grade math contest,

05:38.890 --> 05:39.810
I won first prize.

05:39.810 --> 05:40.980
Try doing that too."

05:45.190 --> 05:46.480
That's...

05:47.720 --> 05:48.720
quite a good idea.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.010
Help a sis out.

05:56.810 --> 05:59.290
[Han Geng fans group chat]

05:58.010 --> 05:59.390
Who has tickets?

06:01.510 --> 06:03.260
[Han Geng fans group chat]

06:03.290 --> 06:09.290
[I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 400 to the base price.]

06:03.720 --> 06:07.450
I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 400 to the base price...

06:09.340 --> 06:11.930
[I sincerely beg for a ticket.
Willing to add 800 to the base price.]

06:10.220 --> 06:11.010
800.

06:12.030 --> 06:16.850
[Han Geng fans group chat]

06:16.920 --> 06:18.330
[I didn't get one too.]

06:18.350 --> 06:19.840
[Same here. Also looking to tickets.]

06:19.860 --> 06:21.810
[Cries—I've got no tickets too.]

06:21.890 --> 06:22.860
[Wang Dao 888]

06:22.920 --> 06:26.530
[I know someone.]

06:34.120 --> 06:35.250
The deposit is here.

06:53.950 --> 06:54.830
Angel's Tears!

06:58.070 --> 06:59.310
Did you just

06:59.720 --> 07:01.320
meet another online friend?

07:02.070 --> 07:04.000
What's this online friend's name?

07:04.160 --> 07:06.040
Em0b01?

07:07.480 --> 07:09.190
I'm in a good mood today,

07:09.190 --> 07:10.590
so I won't argue with you.

07:11.270 --> 07:12.470
What's the good news?

07:15.870 --> 07:17.190
I got the tickets!

07:18.950 --> 07:20.600
I'm deaf now, Sis.

07:21.680 --> 07:22.560
No way.

07:22.630 --> 07:24.160
How did you get the tickets?

07:24.560 --> 07:26.420
There's a trick to chasing stars.

07:26.430 --> 07:27.680
Did you see that guy just now?

07:27.680 --> 07:28.870
That was Qian.

07:29.800 --> 07:30.920
Who's that?

07:31.270 --> 07:33.190
Han Geng's cousin.

07:33.310 --> 07:34.070
He's from Mudanjiang.

07:34.070 --> 07:35.190
A real insider.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.680
Didn't you notice his eyes

07:37.680 --> 07:38.750
and his nose

07:38.750 --> 07:40.409
look exactly like Han Geng's?

07:41.510 --> 07:43.040
Han Geng's cousin?

07:43.480 --> 07:45.310
Why would he be in our city?

07:45.870 --> 07:47.510
Every time Han Geng has a concert,

07:47.510 --> 07:49.680
his team would go
in advance for promotion.

07:49.680 --> 07:50.480
And then,

07:50.480 --> 07:52.560
they release some internal tickets
to hardcore fans.

07:52.560 --> 07:54.159
They're all the best seats.

07:54.430 --> 07:55.800
Pay half as a deposit first,

07:55.800 --> 07:57.270
and when you get the ticket at the venue,

07:57.270 --> 07:58.530
you pay the other half.

07:58.950 --> 07:59.950
This way,

07:59.950 --> 08:02.510
it's hundreds cheaper
than a scalper ticket.

08:04.750 --> 08:07.480
This sounds exactly like a scalper.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.750
It's too professional,

08:11.750 --> 08:13.800
you wouldn't understand
even if I explained it.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.190
What a waste of my time.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.430
I got the tickets!

08:35.010 --> 08:36.200
That was Qian.

08:38.200 --> 08:40.080
Han Geng's cousin.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.670
Pay a part of the deposit first,

08:46.670 --> 08:47.960
and when you get the ticket at the venue,

08:47.960 --> 08:49.270
you pay the other half.

08:50.270 --> 08:52.800
It's hundreds cheaper
than a scalper ticket.

08:57.720 --> 08:58.840
This isn't right.

08:59.870 --> 09:02.730
There's definitely something wrong
with that guy.

09:23.960 --> 09:24.440
Mom?

09:25.100 --> 09:25.500
Dad?

09:43.200 --> 09:50.130
[Duan Qiyan is prohibited from using this]

09:57.270 --> 10:00.050
[Han Geng]

10:07.260 --> 10:08.870
[Attention:
girls who are going to the concert.]

10:08.900 --> 10:10.000
[There's been a scammer going around
scamming fans.]

10:11.950 --> 10:13.580
[Han Geng Forum]

10:13.660 --> 10:15.580
[I heard people bought fake tickets.
This person target fans.]

10:19.930 --> 10:21.820
[Someone took a photo of the scammer.]

10:20.000 --> 10:21.320
I can't even...

10:22.550 --> 10:24.720
tell how this person looks like.

10:27.060 --> 10:28.310
[Han Geng scalper tickets]

10:28.440 --> 10:28.720
[Han Geng wanted to do a special concert,]

10:28.750 --> 10:29.260
[yet scalpers drive the prices up.]

10:33.590 --> 10:34.600
[Where is Han Geng from?]

10:37.480 --> 10:38.880
[Does Han Geng have a cousin?]

10:42.600 --> 10:43.390
Jeez!

10:45.670 --> 10:46.480
Sorry.

10:46.650 --> 10:49.380
The number you dialed is out of service.
Sorry...

10:51.320 --> 10:53.270
She has money for a concert
but not for her phone bill.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.510
Seriously...

10:58.270 --> 10:59.030
Ma'am.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.790
Is Tingting home?

11:00.790 --> 11:02.150
She went to her grandmother's house.

11:02.150 --> 11:04.950
Said she wanted to eat
her grandmother's cooking.

11:05.910 --> 11:07.510
To her grandmother's house?

11:09.720 --> 11:10.200
Duan.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.820
Why are you looking for Tingting?

11:15.080 --> 11:16.200
Nothing, Ma'am.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.880
I was going to ask her a math question.

11:17.880 --> 11:18.840
If she's not here, never mind.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.030
I'll get going.

11:20.030 --> 11:20.600
Bye-bye.

11:20.750 --> 11:21.280
Bye-bye.

11:22.910 --> 11:25.110
Are you sure Tang Tingting got scammed?

11:25.360 --> 11:26.240
Of course.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.840
Although I'm not 100% sure,

11:27.840 --> 11:29.080
my intuition tells me

11:29.080 --> 11:31.480
there's definitely something wrong
with that guy.

11:31.480 --> 11:32.470
Why?

11:33.440 --> 11:35.670
Paying a deposit
before getting the ticket—

11:35.670 --> 11:37.120
it's most likely a scam.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.360
Besides,

11:39.030 --> 11:42.030
I found a very important piece
of evidence!

11:51.770 --> 11:54.440
Han Geng doesn't have a cousin!

12:03.550 --> 12:05.630
Tang Tingting told me

12:06.140 --> 12:08.150
that the scalper is Han Geng's cousin.

12:08.150 --> 12:09.010
So I went online

12:09.010 --> 12:10.130
and searched for a whole morning.

12:10.130 --> 12:12.060
But Han Geng doesn't have a cousin!

12:14.100 --> 12:15.050
You searched online for the whole morning?

12:15.050 --> 12:15.860
All morning.

12:17.080 --> 12:18.120
No matter what,

12:18.440 --> 12:19.530
we have to find him.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.690
What if something bad happens?

12:21.840 --> 12:23.040
But how do we find her?

12:23.270 --> 12:26.070
We don't even know
where she went to get the ticket.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.510
I have a idea.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.000
But I need your help.

12:41.570 --> 12:44.690
[No use of Duan Qiyan]

12:45.510 --> 12:46.320
Let's do this.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.000
Don't panic.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.480
Let's do this one by one.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.880
Actually, this is very simple.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.440
Since we can't find Tang Tingting,

13:04.480 --> 13:06.270
we go directly to Qian.

13:06.360 --> 13:08.480
The local fan group chat must have clues.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.440
We can just sneak in

13:09.440 --> 13:10.500
and take a look.

13:18.930 --> 13:20.950
[Would you like to join "Geng Babes"
as "Death Scythe"?]

13:23.690 --> 13:24.790
[The moderator
has rejected your application.]

13:29.360 --> 13:29.760
Heh...

13:30.820 --> 13:32.270
Local fan group chats like this

13:32.270 --> 13:34.100
usually only admit hardcore fans.

13:34.100 --> 13:36.250
With a profile picture of Kobe

13:36.440 --> 13:38.440
and a username like "Death Scythe,"

13:38.840 --> 13:40.370
you're obviously not a fan.

13:41.270 --> 13:41.980
Let me do it.

13:48.030 --> 13:49.260
[Personal information:
One & Only Geng]

13:51.630 --> 13:52.360
This is good.

13:52.430 --> 13:53.630
[The moderator
has approved your application.]

13:53.840 --> 13:54.670
You're in!

13:55.960 --> 13:57.220
That's amazing, Shen.

13:59.730 --> 14:00.010
[Geng Babes]

14:00.090 --> 14:01.740
[Genggeng Forever
invites you to "Geng Babes'" voice call]

14:01.740 --> 14:04.220
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

14:02.010 --> 14:02.790
Please answer the voice call.

14:02.790 --> 14:04.590
I'll give you the test right now.

14:04.910 --> 14:05.550
Here.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.870
Voice test?

14:09.550 --> 14:10.240
Hello?

14:11.480 --> 14:13.360
I'm a moderator, Genggeng Forever.

14:13.360 --> 14:15.910
We will now test you
for the group chat admission.

14:15.910 --> 14:17.570
What is Han Geng's debut date?

14:22.010 --> 14:22.670
Do you know?

14:24.400 --> 14:24.630
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

14:24.710 --> 14:25.790
[You've been kicked out
of the group chat by the moderator.]

14:28.000 --> 14:29.010
Well, Shen,

14:29.670 --> 14:31.000
you're not a fan either.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.130
Duan Qiyan, you type fast.

14:33.130 --> 14:34.440
I'll take the call later.

14:34.440 --> 14:36.000
You just search for the answer online.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.670
Okay.

14:40.180 --> 14:40.620
[Geng Babes]

14:40.680 --> 14:42.020
[Genggeng Forever]

14:41.480 --> 14:42.720
Hello.

14:42.870 --> 14:46.120
I'm Hearts4Geng.

14:46.240 --> 14:48.220
We will now conduct
the group admission test.

14:47.490 --> 14:48.530
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

14:48.370 --> 14:49.900
What is Han Geng's fan song?

14:50.870 --> 14:51.520
[Han Geng's fan song]

14:53.860 --> 14:55.170
[Han Geng's fan song]

14:54.460 --> 14:55.390
"Wings of Love."

14:56.220 --> 14:56.820
Very good.

14:57.320 --> 14:59.980
Which year
did Han Geng have a hellish schedule?

15:00.370 --> 15:01.450
[Han Geng hellish schedule]

15:01.790 --> 15:02.580
2009.

15:02.790 --> 15:04.240
Okay, the last question.

15:04.410 --> 15:05.870
Please listen carefully.

15:08.680 --> 15:10.510
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

15:17.150 --> 15:18.630
Please name this song.

15:20.100 --> 15:20.820
I...

15:22.490 --> 15:23.580
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

15:25.320 --> 15:26.000
Do you know?

15:26.120 --> 15:27.010
I don't.

15:27.150 --> 15:27.270
[One & Only Geng] [Genggeng Forever]

15:27.270 --> 15:27.760
[Please answer the voice call.
I'll give you the test right now.]

15:27.760 --> 15:28.490
[You've been kicked out
of the group chat by the moderator.]

15:37.240 --> 15:38.240
What should we do?

15:38.360 --> 15:40.420
Han Geng has over a dozen songs so far.

15:40.720 --> 15:41.840
Who could figure out the song

15:41.840 --> 15:44.100
just by listening to it for a few seconds?

16:10.100 --> 16:12.960
Memorizing the intros
to over a dozen songs in a short time

16:12.960 --> 16:14.740
is an impossible task for someone like me

16:14.740 --> 16:16.170
who can't sing.

16:17.220 --> 16:18.370
But memorizing images

16:18.370 --> 16:19.630
is a piece of cake to me.

16:20.340 --> 16:22.150
I can give this method a try.

16:28.850 --> 16:29.970
[Han Geng-"The Moth Rushes Toward Fire"]

16:30.270 --> 16:31.820
"The Moth Rushes Toward Fire."

16:31.820 --> 16:32.750
That's correct.

16:34.980 --> 16:36.210
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

16:36.390 --> 16:37.190
"Separated."

16:37.500 --> 16:38.430
That's correct.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.640
The last song.

16:42.860 --> 16:44.270
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

16:45.510 --> 16:46.600
"Life is But a Dream."

16:46.600 --> 16:47.530
That's correct.

16:49.200 --> 16:51.240
Welcome to the Geng Babes family.

16:49.250 --> 16:50.420
[Baby Genggeng] [Genggeng Forever]

16:56.460 --> 16:57.530
Does anyone know Qian?

16:56.500 --> 16:57.550
[Welcome to the Geng Babes family.]

16:58.580 --> 16:59.820
Tell them you want to buy tickets too.

16:59.820 --> 17:00.820
Yes, say you're looking for a ticket.

16:59.870 --> 17:01.500
[Does anyone know Qian?]

17:01.240 --> 17:02.150
I'm looking for a ticket.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.270
[I'm looking for a ticket.]

17:07.960 --> 17:09.109
Let's see how he replies.

17:09.109 --> 17:10.200
He's distributing tickets

17:10.200 --> 17:12.680
at the small gate on the west side
of the venue at 4:30 PM today.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.609
-Got it.
-Got it.

17:14.589 --> 17:15.440
Let's go. What are you waiting for?

17:15.440 --> 17:15.720
Go!

17:15.740 --> 17:16.940
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

17:26.069 --> 17:26.880
Jiang Yubai.

17:27.440 --> 17:29.000
Do you want to switch seats?

17:29.110 --> 17:31.350
Isn't it too crowded for you 3 guys?

17:36.880 --> 17:37.640
Sure—

17:37.640 --> 17:38.440
Nope.

17:41.240 --> 17:43.400
I-I-I really like sitting in the middle.

17:43.400 --> 17:45.160
The middle has a wide view—it's great.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.790
And it feels snug.

17:46.880 --> 17:47.940
Very comfortable.

17:48.680 --> 17:49.480
What?

17:50.720 --> 17:51.520
It feels snug.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.350
Is that so?

17:52.350 --> 17:53.000
Yeah.

17:53.400 --> 17:55.310
It's a bit too squeezy
on my side right now.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.400
That's too snug.

17:56.400 --> 17:57.330
That's too much.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.240
Shen!

17:58.790 --> 17:59.720
Stop squeezing.

17:59.960 --> 18:00.960
L-Let's set off.

18:01.460 --> 18:01.990
Let's go.

18:02.010 --> 18:02.540
Let's go.

18:23.240 --> 18:24.420
Duan Qiyan, wait up!

18:27.030 --> 18:27.830
Tang.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.030
Sorry.

18:33.220 --> 18:33.880
Sorry.

18:37.350 --> 18:38.550
Tang! Tang!

18:38.830 --> 18:40.490
Sorry, I got the wrong person.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.400
Duan Qiyan, why are you here?

18:53.790 --> 18:54.750
Your phone is out of credit.

18:54.750 --> 18:56.400
Couldn't you have topped it up?

18:56.400 --> 18:57.200
Really?

18:57.790 --> 18:59.310
What were you calling me for?

18:59.310 --> 19:00.910
Something's up, obviously.

19:00.920 --> 19:03.250
Duan Qiyan, why did you run off so quickly?

19:04.350 --> 19:05.510
Why are you all here?

19:06.350 --> 19:07.410
You got the ticket?

19:09.510 --> 19:11.370
But... But where's that scammer?

19:11.480 --> 19:13.140
The guy who you met yesterday?

19:13.400 --> 19:14.960
I'll tell you again.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.730
He's not a swindler. He's Qian.

19:16.880 --> 19:18.030
He was just here.

19:18.160 --> 19:19.360
He gave me the ticket.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.480
Can I have a look?

19:26.920 --> 19:27.720
First row?

19:29.550 --> 19:31.410
Is this Qian really that amazing?

19:34.010 --> 19:34.490
[Beyond the Prologue 2010]

19:34.520 --> 19:35.960
[World Tour—Nanhai Stop]

19:36.180 --> 19:36.850
[Beyond the Prologue World Tour—Nanhai Stop]

19:39.110 --> 19:40.000
Wait.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.520
The English word for "Stadium"—

19:44.350 --> 19:46.070
it's typed as "Stadiam."

19:49.420 --> 19:52.220
Would official tickets
make this kind of mistake?

20:00.590 --> 20:01.400
Impossible.

20:01.400 --> 20:02.440
Scan it again.

20:02.440 --> 20:04.070
My ticket can't be fake.

20:04.720 --> 20:07.310
Young girl, your ticket is obviously fake.

20:07.790 --> 20:10.850
Real tickets have official watermarks
and holo marks.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.920
Plus, in this section,

20:12.920 --> 20:14.520
there is no such seat number.

20:15.110 --> 20:18.200
Are you sure you bought it
through an official platform?

20:18.200 --> 20:20.270
I bought it from a friend.

20:20.790 --> 20:22.240
He's Han Geng's cousin.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.720
He promised it was real.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.640
Cousin?

20:24.830 --> 20:26.560
Yeah right, Han Geng's cousin.

20:26.590 --> 20:27.510
Duan Qiyan!

20:27.960 --> 20:28.790
Stop talking.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.750
Didn't I tell you?

20:38.750 --> 20:40.610
That guy was obviously a scammer.

20:40.790 --> 20:41.920
Tang Tingting, how old are you?

20:41.920 --> 20:42.880
You keep falling for this,

20:42.880 --> 20:44.010
over and over again.

20:45.000 --> 20:46.110
Look around now.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.400
There is not a single soul here.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.160
Where are you going to catch him?

20:48.160 --> 20:49.000
He ran away long ago.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.720
Can you just shut up?

20:51.200 --> 20:53.550
I saved up for half a year just for this.

20:54.350 --> 20:55.310
Mind your own business.

20:55.310 --> 20:56.640
So what if I got scammed?

21:00.960 --> 21:01.550
Hey...

21:03.160 --> 21:04.110
Don't cry.

21:04.110 --> 21:05.510
I was wrong, okay?

21:05.640 --> 21:09.040
I'm just worried about you
and am doing this for your own good.

21:13.880 --> 21:16.000
All right, as long as you're okay.

21:16.590 --> 21:17.400
Yeah.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.480
Let's go.

21:19.550 --> 21:20.720
Let's go home.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.680
I'll just consider it
a lesson learned with money.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.510
No.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.750
You didn't do anything wrong.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.750
Why should you pay to learn a lesson?

21:31.160 --> 21:32.020
Tang Tingting.

21:33.000 --> 21:34.600
Give me Qian's phone number.

22:13.350 --> 22:13.750
Hello?

22:13.810 --> 22:14.340
Who is it?

22:14.880 --> 22:16.330
Hello, is this Qian?

22:16.920 --> 22:18.850
Do you still have concert tickets?

22:19.160 --> 22:19.550
Yes.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.720
I need them urgently.

22:21.930 --> 22:23.590
I'll pay whatever extra you want.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.720
How many do you need?

22:25.050 --> 22:25.680
How many?

22:27.850 --> 22:29.500
Two. Including me.

22:29.810 --> 22:30.870
I'm her boyfriend.

22:33.790 --> 22:34.120
Sure.

22:35.070 --> 22:36.400
But it's about to start.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.660
You have to pay extra.

22:37.660 --> 22:38.610
880 a ticket.

22:39.180 --> 22:40.980
Plus the fee for adjacent seats.

22:41.460 --> 22:42.500
That'd be 2,200.

22:43.340 --> 22:44.480
Sure, no problem.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.950
Where should we meet?

22:47.180 --> 22:48.530
The milk tea shop
on the west street of the stadium.

22:48.530 --> 22:49.590
You know it, right?

22:49.900 --> 22:50.750
Let's meet there.

22:50.750 --> 22:51.550
In 20 minutes.

22:52.030 --> 22:53.140
I'll wait for you on the 1st floor.

22:53.140 --> 22:53.960
Be quick.

22:54.110 --> 22:56.400
There won't be tickets left
if you're late.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.930
Okay, we'll be right there.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.510
Jiang Yubai.

23:01.920 --> 23:04.380
Why did you suddenly
add a role for yourself?

23:05.480 --> 23:08.210
Are you comfortable
letting Lin Zhixia go alone?

23:09.640 --> 23:11.750
Let's go. We only have 20 minutes.

23:12.330 --> 23:13.390
Who brought money?

23:13.920 --> 23:16.310
Zhixia, who goes out with 2,200?

23:18.920 --> 23:19.790
Just in case.

23:20.070 --> 23:21.800
I happen to have brought money.

23:35.110 --> 23:36.200
Are you Qian?

23:38.830 --> 23:40.230
I would like the tickets.

23:42.030 --> 23:43.430
Who is this handsome guy?

23:47.200 --> 23:48.310
I'm her boyfriend.

23:50.920 --> 23:52.250
Did you bring the money?

23:57.330 --> 23:58.590
You're too late.

23:58.590 --> 24:00.200
The ticket check is about to start.

24:00.200 --> 24:01.920
Here, hurry up.

24:03.790 --> 24:05.310
Aren't you going to check the amount?

24:05.310 --> 24:07.510
No need. Your show is about to start.

24:07.510 --> 24:09.040
Hurry up. Don't waste time.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.200
Hold on.

24:11.310 --> 24:13.710
Count the money carefully before leaving.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.310
Fine, I'll count it.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.510
Let me count it.

24:26.680 --> 24:29.200
All right. Let me see.

24:33.240 --> 24:33.970
Are you okay?

24:38.550 --> 24:39.350
Trying to run, huh?

24:39.350 --> 24:40.110
I won't run!

24:40.160 --> 24:42.240
I won't run. I won't run.

24:43.070 --> 24:44.030
Ouch, ouch.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.160
The police are here!

24:45.510 --> 24:46.020
The police are here.

24:46.020 --> 24:47.050
The police are here.

24:47.050 --> 24:48.180
The police are here.

24:48.180 --> 24:48.920
Officer!

24:49.640 --> 24:51.700
It's him. He's selling fake tickets.

24:52.590 --> 24:55.200
Officer, this is nonsense.

24:55.350 --> 24:56.350
Tell me—

24:56.480 --> 24:58.640
where do I even have a single ticket?

24:58.920 --> 25:00.550
I don't have any tickets on me.

25:00.550 --> 25:02.200
On what basis do you say
I'm selling fake tickets?

25:02.200 --> 25:03.400
Stop lying.

25:03.640 --> 25:05.480
You're the head fan
they mentioned on the forum.

25:05.480 --> 25:06.270
It's him.

25:06.270 --> 25:07.720
He swore he would have tickets.

25:07.720 --> 25:08.960
But he just scammed me.

25:08.960 --> 25:09.830
Listen, miss.

25:10.270 --> 25:11.480
In this internet age,

25:11.640 --> 25:13.510
you can't even tell
if you're talking to a person

25:13.510 --> 25:14.790
or a machine online.

25:14.790 --> 25:16.110
Why do you say it was me?

25:16.110 --> 25:17.110
Do you have proof?

25:19.830 --> 25:21.680
If you didn't sell us fake tickets,

25:21.680 --> 25:23.380
then why do you have our money?

25:25.030 --> 25:26.640
This is even more ridiculous.

25:26.640 --> 25:27.370
She's saying

25:27.640 --> 25:28.840
that my money is hers.

25:29.440 --> 25:29.940
What?

25:30.310 --> 25:31.070
If you call out to it,

25:31.070 --> 25:32.130
will it answer you?

25:33.350 --> 25:34.290
I can.

25:39.920 --> 25:42.400
RE72591436.

25:42.720 --> 25:45.000
RT68604243.

25:45.400 --> 25:47.830
QM59284713.

25:48.440 --> 25:50.380
To prove that Qian is indeed suspicious,

25:50.380 --> 25:53.310
we had to memorize
the serial numbers on these bills.

25:53.350 --> 25:56.160
You memorized all of them
in such a short time?

25:56.790 --> 25:57.990
Don't we have phones?

25:58.070 --> 25:59.330
We just took pictures.

26:00.750 --> 26:02.900
CT12377756.

26:03.380 --> 26:06.140
AB74255931.

26:06.570 --> 26:09.160
EM08351742.

26:09.790 --> 26:12.460
XY14709265.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.640
All correct.

26:18.140 --> 26:20.880
Didn't you just glance at them
when taking the pictures?

26:20.880 --> 26:22.610
And I just memorized them then.

26:23.440 --> 26:25.270
To prevent getting scammed,

26:25.270 --> 26:27.480
we specifically memorized them
before buying the tickets.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.880
Of course, we will need the officers

26:28.880 --> 26:30.480
to verify who they belong to.

26:31.310 --> 26:34.030
But once it's verified
that the money is indeed ours,

26:34.030 --> 26:35.960
even if you don't admit
to selling us fake tickets,

26:35.960 --> 26:37.000
you'll still have to explain

26:37.000 --> 26:39.160
why our money is with you.

26:40.070 --> 26:41.350
If you can't explain it...

26:41.350 --> 26:42.750
We can reasonably suspect

26:42.750 --> 26:44.210
that you committed theft.

26:44.240 --> 26:44.780
Hey.

26:44.810 --> 26:46.030
Fraud or theft—

26:46.310 --> 26:47.160
pick one.

26:47.940 --> 26:48.270
They...

26:48.270 --> 26:48.750
Bro.

26:49.640 --> 26:51.440
You thought hiding would keep you safe,

26:51.440 --> 26:54.300
but you didn't expect us
to have the smartest brain.

26:58.350 --> 26:59.790
Doing a good deed a day

27:00.000 --> 27:02.550
will keep the moonlight bright at night.

27:02.960 --> 27:03.750
Tang,

27:03.960 --> 27:06.030
I didn't expect you to do a good deed.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.610
The police said

27:07.830 --> 27:09.480
that he is an experienced scammer.

27:09.480 --> 27:11.680
He's not one to admit
to selling fake tickets.

27:11.680 --> 27:13.640
This is thanks to you, Zhixia.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.040
How did you think of that?

27:15.790 --> 27:16.790
I just felt

27:16.790 --> 27:18.880
that the reason he used cash

27:19.110 --> 27:20.960
must be because
he was afraid of being traced.

27:20.960 --> 27:22.160
Since when making the deal,

27:22.160 --> 27:23.510
he had no witnesses or evidence,

27:23.510 --> 27:26.030
we'd have to create witnesses
and evidence for him.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.960
Anyway, our money is with him.

27:28.270 --> 27:30.470
He has to admit to either theft or fraud.

27:32.350 --> 27:33.680
We're also lucky today.

27:33.830 --> 27:35.200
If the scalper wasn't greedy,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.200
he wouldn't have come back.

27:36.200 --> 27:36.830
Right.

27:37.550 --> 27:39.720
Fortunately,
apart from missing the concert,

27:39.720 --> 27:41.120
we didn't lose anything.

27:43.350 --> 27:45.590
I just want to see a concert.

27:46.070 --> 27:47.800
What use do I have for the money?

27:48.160 --> 27:49.680
And Han Geng is here only for one concert

27:49.680 --> 27:51.030
this year.

27:52.750 --> 27:55.000
Why is it so hard to watch a concert?

27:58.030 --> 27:59.350
If you want to watch the concert,

27:59.350 --> 28:00.550
it's not impossible.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.980
When we walked over just now,

28:03.980 --> 28:04.890
I noticed that

28:04.920 --> 28:07.520
the acoustics
in each area are a bit different.

28:07.680 --> 28:10.070
Looking at the structure of this venue,

28:10.290 --> 28:12.820
there must be a place
with the best acoustics.

28:14.290 --> 28:15.220
Let's go find it.

28:20.980 --> 28:22.910
That was my first time at a concert.

28:24.180 --> 28:25.640
Even though before today,

28:26.070 --> 28:28.400
I didn't even know who was singing inside.

28:30.090 --> 28:32.650
But now, as soon as I hear the intro,

28:33.400 --> 28:34.880
I know the name of the song.

28:37.700 --> 28:38.850
I know the propagation characteristics

28:38.850 --> 28:41.180
of high-frequency
and low-frequency sound waves.

28:41.180 --> 28:42.700
I also took Tang Tingting and the others

28:42.700 --> 28:45.430
to find the spot outside
with the best acoustics.

28:48.380 --> 28:50.580
There were people waving light sticks,

28:50.920 --> 28:53.050
instantly lighting up a sea of lights.

28:53.960 --> 28:55.420
We hummed songs out of tune

28:55.810 --> 28:56.940
and danced stiffly.

28:57.900 --> 29:00.550
I can't remember
the muffled singing inside,

29:01.700 --> 29:03.230
but my memory of the concert

29:03.810 --> 29:07.110
is paused at the starry sky
we lit up for ourselves

29:07.850 --> 29:10.250
with flashlights and out-of-tune voices.

29:15.750 --> 29:18.640
Our Han Geng is so handsome.

29:20.200 --> 29:22.960
Did you see Han Geng in person today?

29:23.000 --> 29:23.790
Mind your own business.

29:23.790 --> 29:26.320
Han Geng is just handsome.
The most handsome.

29:26.790 --> 29:27.850
Right, Duan Qiyan?

29:28.640 --> 29:30.750
Yes, Han Geng is handsome.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.600
What are you thinking about?

29:39.110 --> 29:40.170
I'm thinking about

29:40.240 --> 29:42.240
how I gained a new experience today.

29:42.590 --> 29:44.160
It's my first time at a concert,

29:44.160 --> 29:45.880
and it was with you too.

29:48.550 --> 29:50.070
I realize a lot of my firsts

29:50.070 --> 29:51.350
are with you.

29:52.110 --> 29:53.910
My first time having a deskmate.

29:54.400 --> 29:56.680
My first time
receiving a birthday present.

29:56.680 --> 29:58.610
My first time going to an aquarium.

30:00.030 --> 30:00.830
Then,

30:01.610 --> 30:03.670
is there anything else you want to do?

30:08.260 --> 30:10.790
I hope that
when I go to Mars for the first time,

30:10.830 --> 30:12.400
you can be by my side too.

30:17.680 --> 30:18.480
Do you want some?

30:18.480 --> 30:19.880
No, I'm too full.

30:20.590 --> 30:21.310
Shen.

30:22.160 --> 30:22.830
Shen!

30:24.160 --> 30:25.090
Do you want some?

30:26.350 --> 30:27.070
Thanks.

30:27.070 --> 30:29.850
I want to go... to the National Museum,

30:30.200 --> 30:31.240
the Louvre,

30:31.900 --> 30:33.090
an amusement park,

30:33.290 --> 30:33.850
a water park—

30:33.850 --> 30:34.900
This can be done.

30:36.640 --> 30:38.030
Let's go to the amusement park tomorrow.

30:38.030 --> 30:38.510
Sure!

30:40.030 --> 30:41.690
Amusement park? Sounds good.

30:42.350 --> 30:43.680
-Hey, I'm not...
-Didn't you ask

30:43.680 --> 30:46.050
if we want to go
to the amusement park tomorrow?

30:46.050 --> 30:46.850
I meant...

30:46.900 --> 30:48.700
Hey, Duan Qiyan, Tang Tingting.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.680
Jiang Yubai is asking if we want to go
to the amusement park tomorrow.

30:50.680 --> 30:51.480
-Sure!
-Sure!

30:51.550 --> 30:52.240
Tell you what,

30:52.240 --> 30:54.000
it's my treat. To thank you guys.

30:54.000 --> 30:54.640
Sure!

31:18.000 --> 31:22.150
[Fantasy Kingdom]

31:19.920 --> 31:22.070
Friends, let's be the first ones in!

31:22.510 --> 31:23.550
I'm so sleepy.

31:23.680 --> 31:26.160
We have a really intense schedule
this weekend.

31:26.160 --> 31:27.400
I made a plan last night.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.510
We must complete

31:28.510 --> 31:30.400
every single ride today.

31:31.240 --> 31:32.700
Thank you, Tang Tingting.

31:32.880 --> 31:33.880
My parents are busy with work,

31:33.880 --> 31:35.270
so they never brought me here.

31:35.270 --> 31:36.350
It's no big deal.

31:36.510 --> 31:39.440
Of course you come to an amusement park
with friends.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.110
Let's go.

31:40.420 --> 31:40.830
Let's go.

31:40.830 --> 31:41.360
Let's go.

31:42.170 --> 31:43.890
[Fantasy Kingdom]

31:45.240 --> 31:45.980
Hello!

31:46.310 --> 31:47.310
Are you students?

31:47.380 --> 31:48.030
Yes.

31:48.400 --> 31:50.590
Our amusement park
recently launched a new event.

31:50.500 --> 31:52.700
[Mission Box]

31:50.960 --> 31:51.750
It's called the Mission Card event.

31:51.750 --> 31:53.050
Would you like to have a try?

31:53.050 --> 31:54.590
What is it about?

31:54.720 --> 31:55.500
Here's how it works:

31:55.500 --> 31:57.030
when you enter the park later,

31:55.880 --> 31:56.690
[Mission Box]

31:57.030 --> 31:57.880
everyone will wear

31:57.880 --> 31:59.570
a badge like this on their chest.

31:59.570 --> 32:00.970
[Mission Box]

31:59.640 --> 32:00.790
Then from my box,

32:00.790 --> 32:02.680
you'll draw your hidden missions.

32:02.680 --> 32:04.770
You have to complete this mission

32:04.770 --> 32:06.110
avoiding getting caught by others.

32:06.110 --> 32:07.640
Once someone successfully calls you out,

32:07.640 --> 32:08.750
your mission fails,

32:08.750 --> 32:10.850
and this badge will go to them.

32:11.000 --> 32:12.400
When you leave the park,

32:12.510 --> 32:14.240
whoever has the most badges

32:13.420 --> 32:15.500
[Mission Box]

32:14.380 --> 32:15.440
will be the winner.

32:17.480 --> 32:19.200
That sounds quite interesting.

32:19.200 --> 32:19.720
Yeah.

32:19.720 --> 32:21.550
We have a lot of people, so it's perfect.

32:21.550 --> 32:22.510
I don't think

32:22.640 --> 32:24.500
anyone likes losing in our class.

32:24.790 --> 32:26.390
I might not beat you in exams,

32:26.480 --> 32:28.240
but I'm pretty good at playing games.

32:28.240 --> 32:30.830
You've successfully ignited
my competitive spirit.

32:30.830 --> 32:31.550
Bring it on!

32:32.720 --> 32:33.380
Let's do it.

32:43.050 --> 32:45.070
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

32:45.120 --> 32:47.420
[Touch each player's hand once]

32:55.900 --> 32:57.610
For every player, each of you

32:57.610 --> 32:59.200
only has one chance to call them out.

32:59.200 --> 33:01.930
If you are not sure,
please don't use it casually.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.160
Enjoy!

33:03.960 --> 33:04.420
Thanks!

33:04.940 --> 33:05.470
Let's go.

33:05.880 --> 33:06.210
Okay.

33:08.680 --> 33:09.830
Princess.

33:09.900 --> 33:11.960
Her Royal Highness the Princess
has arrived.

33:11.960 --> 33:13.180
Look at this.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.200
How about adding a little flower?

33:15.200 --> 33:17.380
This smell is not right.

33:18.680 --> 33:20.160
It can also block the sun.

33:20.590 --> 33:21.920
Wearing this...

33:22.350 --> 33:24.640
Looks so funny on you.

33:24.640 --> 33:26.030
What is that?

33:26.110 --> 33:27.270
A flower fairy.

33:30.480 --> 33:30.810
Here.

33:33.010 --> 33:33.900
Did you draw the mission

33:33.900 --> 33:37.240
where you have to
hide the weird-flavored candy on everyone?

33:37.240 --> 33:38.620
Hurry up. Let me pay.

33:39.700 --> 33:40.400
[Tang Tingting's Mission]

33:40.420 --> 33:43.760
[Hide the weird-flavored candy
on everyone]

33:43.790 --> 33:45.740
[without being discovered.]

33:47.720 --> 33:48.830
Tingting!

33:52.550 --> 33:53.750
Which one do you want?

33:54.720 --> 33:55.530
Anything is fine.

33:55.530 --> 33:56.400
This one.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.880
I think this one suits you.

34:00.060 --> 34:01.790
Sure. I'll take this one, then.

34:01.790 --> 34:02.590
How much is it?

34:03.270 --> 34:05.550
First, get out of this castle.

34:06.400 --> 34:08.150
And then

34:08.960 --> 34:11.159
let's go to the "Flooded Jinshan" ride.

34:11.510 --> 34:13.110
It's like a giant swing.

34:13.190 --> 34:14.510
Is it that scary?

34:15.400 --> 34:16.600
You'll find out soon.

34:16.760 --> 34:19.440
There's a momentary feeling
of weightlessness on the pirate ship.

34:19.440 --> 34:20.440
Weightlessness?

34:20.960 --> 34:21.960
Sometimes when I dream,

34:21.960 --> 34:23.880
I wake up startled from falling.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.840
Would you be scared?

34:27.070 --> 34:27.870
Probably not.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.440
Every time I come to the amusement park,

34:31.440 --> 34:33.800
I imagine it as an astronaut test,

34:33.880 --> 34:35.010
so I won't be scared.

34:39.690 --> 34:41.020
Next group of visitors.

34:41.030 --> 34:42.560
Be careful and head inside.

34:43.170 --> 34:44.380
I suddenly don't feel so good.

34:44.380 --> 34:45.380
You guys go ahead.

34:45.380 --> 34:46.360
You can give me your stuff.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.560
I'll watch it for you.

34:47.860 --> 34:48.920
Sure.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.489
Can you hold this for me too?

34:53.659 --> 34:55.010
Hurry up.

34:55.670 --> 34:57.130
The ride is about to start.

35:03.840 --> 35:05.640
You guys wait for the next round.

35:08.620 --> 35:09.680
What are you doing?

35:12.480 --> 35:14.800
I... I bought candy for everyone.

35:14.800 --> 35:15.860
I'm passing it out.

35:17.110 --> 35:19.630
Are you trying to complete a mission?

35:20.960 --> 35:22.800
No way.

35:25.280 --> 35:27.550
Tang, you're being too obvious.

35:27.920 --> 35:28.880
Before we came, you said

35:28.880 --> 35:30.940
you wanted to go on all the rides here.

35:31.070 --> 35:32.530
This is only the first one.

35:36.670 --> 35:37.670
Please.

35:37.690 --> 35:39.030
Let me off this time.

35:39.150 --> 35:41.070
It's embarrassing
to be the first one caught.

35:41.070 --> 35:41.760
Nope!

35:43.230 --> 35:44.400
Your mission is...

35:45.550 --> 35:46.760
Are you sure you want to say it?

35:46.760 --> 35:48.190
Everyone only has one chance.

35:48.190 --> 35:50.720
If you guess wrong,
you'll waste your chance.

35:51.760 --> 35:54.880
To sneak everyone candy
without being discovered.

35:55.090 --> 35:55.280
[Tang Tingting's mission:
hide the weird-flavored candy
on everyone]

35:55.300 --> 35:55.490
[without being discovered.]

35:55.520 --> 35:56.700
[Fail]

35:59.800 --> 36:01.070
This is mine now.

36:01.610 --> 36:03.210
Give it to me.

36:08.420 --> 36:09.220
You're no fun.

36:49.280 --> 36:49.880
Was it fun?

36:50.360 --> 36:51.150
It was fun.

36:51.380 --> 36:53.480
I actually like
the feeling of weightlessness.

36:53.480 --> 36:55.550
Then you have the potential
to be an astronaut.

36:55.550 --> 36:56.800
Shen Fuxuan is the impressive one.

36:56.800 --> 36:58.860
He didn't make a sound the whole time.

36:59.150 --> 37:00.210
Are you not scared

37:00.550 --> 37:01.840
because you go on rides often,

37:01.840 --> 37:03.240
or because you're brave?

37:04.820 --> 37:05.500
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

37:05.530 --> 37:08.510
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

37:18.780 --> 37:19.710
I'm brave.

37:19.560 --> 37:19.960
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

37:19.980 --> 37:20.560
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

37:20.580 --> 37:20.950
[Shen Fuxuan: 2 sentences left]

37:24.440 --> 37:25.030
Here.

37:26.630 --> 37:28.320
No wonder you suddenly said
you were not playing earlier.

37:28.320 --> 37:29.480
So this is why.

37:30.440 --> 37:31.570
What's her mission?

37:31.590 --> 37:33.440
To slip candy into everyone's pockets

37:33.440 --> 37:34.770
without being noticed.

37:35.190 --> 37:36.990
But I caught her on the first try.

37:37.900 --> 37:39.070
It's just a side quest.

37:39.070 --> 37:40.070
Why so serious?

37:40.590 --> 37:42.320
You still need to be competitive.

37:42.320 --> 37:43.630
Stop showing off.

37:43.630 --> 37:45.420
I don't even care about this stupid badge.

37:45.420 --> 37:47.400
I just feel relieved now, okay?

37:47.400 --> 37:48.230
Sure, sure.

37:49.030 --> 37:49.710
Let's go.

37:49.920 --> 37:51.450
Next stop, roller coaster.

37:52.210 --> 37:52.760
Let's go.

38:06.190 --> 38:06.840
Shen.

38:07.230 --> 38:08.880
Well, are you scared?

38:09.960 --> 38:13.000
I heard this thing
always malfunctions overseas.

38:13.000 --> 38:13.920
I don't know if it's safe.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.250
He's too scared to ride.

38:17.550 --> 38:18.320
I'm talking to you.

38:18.320 --> 38:19.650
Why are you ignoring me?

38:20.390 --> 38:21.960
You don't have to ride it
if you're scared.

38:21.960 --> 38:23.160
No one is forcing you.

38:24.850 --> 38:27.290
Acrophobia is half hereditary.

38:28.000 --> 38:29.660
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

38:30.230 --> 38:31.840
Seems like you didn't take the pirate ship

38:31.840 --> 38:33.110
cause you were scared.

38:33.110 --> 38:35.530
You just happened
to catch me sneaking candy.

38:35.530 --> 38:36.340
Nonsense.

38:36.370 --> 38:39.030
I'm just a little excited
before getting on.

38:39.190 --> 38:41.760
Also, I'm just communicating with Shen.

38:42.690 --> 38:43.440
Right?

38:45.520 --> 38:46.480
[Please queue in twos]

38:50.190 --> 38:51.820
It must be fun.

39:02.230 --> 39:03.110
Duan Qiyan.

39:04.190 --> 39:06.360
Even though
I've never ridden a roller coaster,

39:06.360 --> 39:07.710
from my observation,

39:08.000 --> 39:10.000
the back row should be the scariest.

39:10.400 --> 39:11.960
Th-The scariest?

39:13.610 --> 39:15.320
When the front row starts to dive,

39:15.320 --> 39:16.590
the back row is still climbing,

39:16.590 --> 39:19.630
converting accumulated potential energy
into stronger acceleration.

39:19.630 --> 39:20.000
Wait.

39:20.000 --> 39:20.360
But—

39:22.240 --> 39:24.100
You want to take this seat, right?

39:25.210 --> 39:26.880
Let's switch, then!

39:27.590 --> 39:28.440
Have my seat.

39:28.460 --> 39:29.270
Go ahead.

39:39.760 --> 39:42.280
Sir, could we switch seats?

39:42.320 --> 39:43.190
Sure.

39:43.190 --> 39:44.000
Thank you.

41:04.190 --> 41:04.960
Are you okay?

41:06.920 --> 41:09.110
You obviously
can't handle high-altitude rides.

41:09.110 --> 41:10.360
Why force yourself?

41:11.960 --> 41:13.760
Guess you can't be an astronaut.

41:15.530 --> 41:17.990
Was your mission
to ride the roller coaster?

41:18.320 --> 41:20.850
Otherwise,
you wouldn't have dared to get on.

41:21.320 --> 41:22.440
It really isn't.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.400
You guessed wrong.

41:23.400 --> 41:24.670
You have no more chances left.

41:24.520 --> 41:25.580
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

41:25.600 --> 41:27.730
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

41:27.760 --> 41:28.620
[Shen Fuxuan: 1 sentence left]

41:41.250 --> 41:42.360
I got it. Your mission is...

41:42.360 --> 41:43.190
Ms. Xia!

41:43.210 --> 41:44.030
No rush.

41:44.030 --> 41:45.190
There's still a long time left
in this game.

41:45.190 --> 41:46.150
Take your time to guess.

41:46.150 --> 41:47.800
If you guess wrong, you lose your chance.

41:47.800 --> 41:51.000
Your mission is to make
a peace sign on the roller coaster.

41:57.400 --> 41:58.360
You got it.

41:58.490 --> 41:59.420
Hand it over.

42:01.080 --> 42:02.250
Hand it over!

42:02.280 --> 42:03.030
Stop!

42:03.550 --> 42:04.710
-You lost.
-Slow down!

42:04.710 --> 42:05.480
Watch my...

42:07.710 --> 42:08.880
Why did you pinch me?

42:09.110 --> 42:10.670
You finally get what you deserve.

42:10.670 --> 42:11.480
Two.

42:22.000 --> 42:23.000
Not bad, Shen.

42:23.510 --> 42:24.400
I guess it's not 100%,

42:24.400 --> 42:24.880
but...

42:24.880 --> 42:25.740
you're not bad.

43:12.760 --> 43:14.480
I have one question.

43:14.900 --> 43:16.780
Just now when we were playing bumper cars,

43:16.780 --> 43:18.910
why did you guys keep crashing into me?

43:19.400 --> 43:21.190
-We didn't.
-We didn't.

43:21.500 --> 43:22.190
Yes, you did.

43:22.190 --> 43:23.670
My back is all red.

43:24.530 --> 43:25.610
So fragile.

43:25.670 --> 43:26.510
Shen Fuxuan.

43:27.550 --> 43:29.810
Help get everyone their ice cream cones.

43:30.000 --> 43:30.670
Sure.

43:32.190 --> 43:33.070
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

43:33.100 --> 43:34.700
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

43:34.720 --> 43:35.620
[Shen Fuxuan: 0 sentences left]

43:36.070 --> 43:37.170
You kept blocking my way.

43:37.170 --> 43:38.820
So I had to crash into you.

43:38.940 --> 43:39.730
I was just...

43:41.670 --> 43:42.320
Thanks.

43:42.320 --> 43:43.340
What about mine, Jiang?

43:43.340 --> 43:44.000
Over there.

43:49.730 --> 43:51.780
My back still hurts from the crash.

43:54.380 --> 43:56.890
Hello. Can you come over here for a sec?

44:01.230 --> 44:01.650
Sure.

44:09.230 --> 44:10.160
What's going on?

44:11.730 --> 44:13.610
Hello.

44:14.380 --> 44:17.010
I feel a connection with you.

44:17.920 --> 44:20.290
Although not as much
as with the guy opposite you,

44:20.290 --> 44:22.360
the athletic high schooler...

44:22.550 --> 44:24.480
You're making that up, aren't you?

44:26.630 --> 44:28.440
I want to be friends with you.

44:28.480 --> 44:31.280
Can I get your contact info?

44:41.360 --> 44:41.960
He gave it.

44:43.760 --> 44:46.070
Jiang is very charming.

44:46.900 --> 44:47.700
Wow, for real?

44:52.760 --> 44:54.220
Let's ride the drop tower.

44:54.780 --> 44:55.640
Sure, let's go!

44:55.960 --> 44:57.190
Let's go!

44:57.760 --> 44:59.720
Come on, we've rested enough. Let's go.

44:59.720 --> 45:00.300
Go.

45:04.710 --> 45:05.300
Where to?

45:05.550 --> 45:06.410
The drop tower.

45:09.050 --> 45:09.710
Jiang.

45:09.940 --> 45:11.920
The gentle senior type like you

45:11.920 --> 45:13.650
is really attractive to girls.

45:13.650 --> 45:14.760
What are you talking about?

45:14.760 --> 45:15.490
What is that?

45:15.590 --> 45:17.390
Don't you think so, Shen Fuxuan?

45:19.630 --> 45:20.800
Why are you acting so weird today?

45:20.800 --> 45:22.030
You haven't said a word.

45:22.030 --> 45:22.960
Did I offend you?

45:27.670 --> 45:28.500
Wait a minute.

45:31.840 --> 45:34.070
Are you doing the side mission?

45:37.750 --> 45:38.590
I got it.

45:39.400 --> 45:41.460
Your mission is to not speak for a day.

45:43.360 --> 45:44.280
He did speak.

45:44.670 --> 45:45.440
Did he?

45:48.820 --> 45:49.960
Let me think...

45:50.850 --> 45:52.270
[Exit]

45:50.980 --> 45:53.610
Are you not scared
because you go on rides often,

45:53.610 --> 45:55.010
or because you're brave?

45:58.320 --> 45:59.300
I'm brave.

45:59.760 --> 46:03.170
[Shen Fuxuan's 1st sentence]

46:00.440 --> 46:02.510
Is your task to ride the roller coaster?

46:02.510 --> 46:03.670
Otherwise, you definitely wouldn't get on.

46:03.250 --> 46:09.220
[Shen Fuxuan's 2nd sentence]

46:04.150 --> 46:07.150
Shen Fuxuan.
Help get everyone their ice cream cones.

46:07.920 --> 46:08.760
Sure.

46:09.220 --> 46:17.840
[Shen Fuxuan's 3rd sentence]

46:14.840 --> 46:16.230
Is your task

46:16.230 --> 46:17.980
not to speak more than 3 sentences a day?

46:17.980 --> 46:18.900
[Shen Fuxuan's Mission]

46:18.920 --> 46:19.930
[You can't talk more than 3 sentences
during the game.]

46:19.960 --> 46:21.180
[Fail]

46:24.860 --> 46:25.840
Good memory.

46:26.880 --> 46:27.710
Hand it over.

46:34.000 --> 46:34.480
Thanks.

46:40.660 --> 46:41.260
Let's go.

46:41.290 --> 46:41.840
Let's go.

46:44.780 --> 46:45.560
We're here!

46:47.590 --> 46:49.670
Wow, that's so high.

46:52.960 --> 46:54.530
I... I need the toilet.

46:57.110 --> 46:58.570
Are you too scared to ride?

46:59.190 --> 47:01.070
How is that possible?

47:01.610 --> 47:02.340
I just ate

47:02.340 --> 47:04.130
too much ice cream just now.

47:04.130 --> 47:05.510
My stomach is a bit upset.

47:05.510 --> 47:06.670
I'll be right back.

47:08.610 --> 47:10.000
He's just scared.

47:10.070 --> 47:11.950
He's been a coward since childhood.

47:11.950 --> 47:12.770
You guys go first.

47:12.770 --> 47:14.550
I must drag him up here today.

47:14.570 --> 47:15.610
I'll help you.

47:19.230 --> 47:20.030
Then how about

47:20.670 --> 47:22.000
the two of us ride first?

47:29.330 --> 47:31.390
Jiang Yubai, you're really popular.

47:39.010 --> 47:40.260
Even a passerby

47:41.000 --> 47:43.000
wants to exchange numbers with you.

47:43.670 --> 47:46.330
I feel like you can make friends
wherever you go.

47:48.230 --> 47:51.440
Actually... I didn't give her my number.

47:54.420 --> 47:55.590
I just feel

47:56.210 --> 47:58.870
it's quite awkward
to reject someone in public.

47:58.960 --> 47:59.880
So I left her

47:59.880 --> 48:01.150
our school's number.

48:03.550 --> 48:06.590
But actually, it's fine
if you left your own number.

48:07.960 --> 48:10.070
I read in a book before:

48:10.590 --> 48:11.880
most friends

48:11.960 --> 48:14.710
can only accompany you
for a part of your life's journey.

48:14.710 --> 48:16.400
When they reach their destination,

48:16.400 --> 48:17.630
they will get off,

48:19.400 --> 48:21.200
and watch you go to the next stop.

48:25.190 --> 48:26.590
You will definitely have

48:26.670 --> 48:28.510
even more friends in the future.

48:29.920 --> 48:31.030
I hope by then,

48:31.760 --> 48:33.490
I can still be your best friend—

48:38.510 --> 48:39.170
one of them.

48:52.940 --> 48:53.650
It stopped.

48:57.630 --> 48:58.710
I-It's so high.

49:00.630 --> 49:01.490
Are you scared?

49:04.480 --> 49:05.280
No.

49:11.670 --> 49:13.000
Actually, a little bit.

49:18.000 --> 49:20.000
Do you have any unfulfilled wishes?

49:20.480 --> 49:23.070
That sounds like an unlucky thing
to be talking about now.

49:23.070 --> 49:23.960
I'm a bit nervous.

49:23.960 --> 49:25.670
I want to distract myself.

49:27.510 --> 49:28.440
All right, then.

49:28.670 --> 49:29.480
Go ahead.

49:29.840 --> 49:30.900
I'll chat with you.

49:34.150 --> 49:35.810
Do you have any other secrets?

49:38.230 --> 49:39.880
I don't think so.

49:40.280 --> 49:41.140
What about you?

49:42.630 --> 49:43.440
I...

49:44.710 --> 49:46.900
Does being about to fall asleep
in a second count?

49:46.900 --> 49:48.110
How does that count?

49:51.630 --> 49:52.320
By the way,

49:54.150 --> 49:55.280
though you just said

49:56.440 --> 49:58.570
that all friends last just for a phase,

49:59.760 --> 50:00.800
I want to say...

50:06.110 --> 50:06.920
I want to

50:08.110 --> 50:09.240
be with you forever.

50:13.590 --> 50:15.590
You will always be my one and only...

50:16.600 --> 50:17.760
best friend.

50:54.230 --> 50:56.610
So this is what it feels like
to ride a drop tower.

50:56.610 --> 50:58.270
When we were up there just now,

50:58.320 --> 51:00.780
for a moment,
I thought we'd never come down.

51:08.360 --> 51:10.320
I saw you were scared, so I...

51:13.320 --> 51:14.850
I'm glad you were by my side.

51:20.550 --> 51:22.590
Duan Qiyan, it's a good thing
you didn't go on the drop tower.

51:22.590 --> 51:23.840
Otherwise, you would've cried.

51:23.840 --> 51:24.770
Is it that scary?

51:25.030 --> 51:26.230
No point telling you.

51:26.320 --> 51:27.440
You didn't even dare to ride it.

51:27.440 --> 51:28.180
Why bother asking?

51:28.180 --> 51:29.440
Cut the crap.

51:29.440 --> 51:31.400
You've been moping all day

51:31.510 --> 51:32.840
and haven't said a word.

51:32.840 --> 51:33.710
You really held it in

51:33.710 --> 51:34.840
just for a side quest.

51:34.840 --> 51:35.550
Cut the crap.

51:35.550 --> 51:37.000
I didn't want to talk today anyway.

51:37.000 --> 51:37.630
Sure.

51:37.840 --> 51:39.230
Keep telling yourself that.

51:39.230 --> 51:41.070
This quest would've killed you
in 10 minutes.

51:41.070 --> 51:42.930
I'm not as competitive as you are!

51:44.590 --> 51:45.550
You guys are out.

51:45.800 --> 51:46.670
How was it today?

51:46.670 --> 51:47.670
Did you have fun?

51:47.710 --> 51:49.310
It was fun, just a bit tiring.

51:51.260 --> 51:52.720
Seems like today's winner

51:52.760 --> 51:53.840
is this lady.

51:55.680 --> 51:56.550
No, no.

51:56.920 --> 51:58.070
I didn't finish my mission,

51:58.070 --> 51:59.330
so it shouldn't count.

52:00.190 --> 52:01.390
What's your mission?

52:02.630 --> 52:04.830
To exchange something with each of you.

52:04.840 --> 52:07.370
But I couldn't find a chance
with Jiang Yubai.

52:09.840 --> 52:11.370
I think this suits you well.

52:11.800 --> 52:13.800
That works. Let's go with this then.

52:14.170 --> 52:15.070
My headband.

52:17.800 --> 52:20.150
Shen Fuxuan,
my gun doesn't seem to work well.

52:20.150 --> 52:21.320
Can we swap?

52:25.400 --> 52:25.860
The gun?

52:26.880 --> 52:27.670
Wait.

52:28.760 --> 52:30.030
What did we exchange?

52:30.920 --> 52:32.180
Roller coaster seats.

52:32.400 --> 52:34.110
You want to take this seat, right?

52:34.110 --> 52:35.840
Let's switch, then!

52:38.400 --> 52:39.360
That's too subtle.

52:39.360 --> 52:40.620
Who would notice that?

52:42.280 --> 52:44.710
Actually,
you exchanged something with me too.

52:44.710 --> 52:45.710
On the drop tower,

52:46.000 --> 52:47.600
didn't we exchange secrets?

52:50.070 --> 52:52.000
You will always be my one and only...

52:52.000 --> 52:53.110
best friend.

53:02.570 --> 53:03.590
Jiang.

53:03.920 --> 53:06.650
You're even helping
your opponent make up for it.

53:07.630 --> 53:09.710
Looks like Lin Zhixia
is 1st place again today,

53:09.710 --> 53:11.070
and I'm Ms. Last Place again.

53:11.070 --> 53:12.360
Isn't that normal?

53:13.920 --> 53:15.250
So what's your mission?

53:19.070 --> 53:19.840
Me?

53:20.030 --> 53:21.090
Hand it over!

53:21.230 --> 53:21.600
[Jiang Yubai's Mission]

53:21.630 --> 53:22.200
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Duan Qiyan]

53:22.230 --> 53:23.220
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Tang Tingting]

53:23.250 --> 53:24.020
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Shen Fuxuan]

53:25.300 --> 53:27.230
I didn't finish my mission either.

53:29.630 --> 53:30.240
[Jiang Yubai's Mission]

53:30.260 --> 53:31.950
[Touch each player's hand once]
[Lin Zhixia]

53:33.230 --> 53:33.860
What is it?

53:35.910 --> 53:37.370
To tell a joke to everyone.

53:39.840 --> 53:40.260
A joke?

53:41.630 --> 53:42.590
You really weren't

53:42.590 --> 53:44.210
participating in this game at all.

53:44.210 --> 53:45.540
It makes me look stupid.

53:45.650 --> 53:47.690
That's so boring of you.

53:48.440 --> 53:49.570
This isn't like you.

53:50.670 --> 53:51.930
I didn't perform well.

53:52.960 --> 53:55.020
Do you guys want to take a group photo?

53:55.320 --> 53:56.610
I'll give it to you for free.

53:56.610 --> 53:57.030
Sure!

53:57.610 --> 53:58.670
Let's go. Come this way.

53:58.670 --> 53:59.000
Okay!

53:59.100 --> 54:00.780
Can't say no to free.

54:01.390 --> 54:02.610
Find your spots.

54:02.610 --> 54:03.800
Strike a pose.

54:04.000 --> 54:06.110
Three, two, one.

54:10.210 --> 54:13.210
I suddenly wish
time could freeze at this moment.

54:14.500 --> 54:16.100
Not because it is so perfect,

54:16.280 --> 54:17.940
but so that when my future self

54:18.030 --> 54:20.480
looks at this photo on some evening,

54:21.260 --> 54:23.630
I can still hear the laughter
of this moment

54:23.630 --> 54:26.430
and feel the warmth
of someone staying close to me.

54:29.440 --> 54:30.510
The years are long.

54:31.510 --> 54:34.440
It is these shining fragments
captured by the camera

54:35.210 --> 54:38.360
that illuminate the highlights
of our lives.

55:16.460 --> 55:18.110
Why aren't you asleep yet?

55:18.400 --> 55:19.460
Explain yourself.

55:19.800 --> 55:20.840
Curfew is at 9 PM.

55:21.360 --> 55:22.420
What time is it now?

55:23.880 --> 55:25.000
I had things to do today.

55:25.000 --> 55:26.460
I already told Mom and Dad.

55:26.840 --> 55:27.770
Is that a reason?

55:27.780 --> 55:28.360
Yes.

